    <li>Accessibility: <a href="mailto:accessibility@intellmeai.com">accessibility@intellmeai.com</a> &mdash; see our <a href="/accessibility">Accessibility statement</a></li>
  </ul>
  <p>We respond within a reasonable timeframe and in accordance with applicable data protection laws.</p>
